{"name": "Overbuffed", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every card has its own upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card has its own set of unique upgrades. Pick the ones that fit your deck and combine them with upgrades on other cards. Even a familiar creature or spell can take on a new role and become the foundation of a completely different build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One great combo can turn an entire run around. Build on it, wipe out whole enemy squads, and see just how far you can push it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/1a49f60e6f07bad88f0e6c1dae3932a4.poster.avif?t=1794571288\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/1a49f60e6f07bad88f0e6c1dae3932a4.webm?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/1a49f60e6f07bad88f0e6c1dae3932a4.mp4?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decide what to build around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every reward brings a choice: strengthen your army for the next fight or start putting together a new combo. Combine card effects with unique weapon upgrades to get the most out of your combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/5cddd854200ee64d225dcd034604f865.poster.avif?t=1794571288\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/5cddd854200ee64d225dcd034604f865.webm?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/5cddd854200ee64d225dcd034604f865.mp4?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready for the bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has its own deck and tricks. Some put your army to sleep, others poison your creatures or call in reinforcements. Your build needs to handle what they throw back at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/64d10054693209e142f5e452fd319ced.poster.avif?t=1794571288\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/64d10054693209e142f5e452fd319ced.webm?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/extras/64d10054693209e142f5e452fd319ced.mp4?t=1794571288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build an army and break the game in a single-player roguelike deckbuilder with auto-battler combat. Each card\u2019s unique upgrades give you boundless freedom to experiment with combos. Fight your way through dangerous floors and take on bosses.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609870/545def93e4c5d8fc5fff9bf6db3d2fadec1e7b7f/header.jpg?t=1794571288", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Auto Battler", "Card Battler", "Deckbuilding", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "relfor", "publishers": "relfor", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4609870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "13 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UTeu4w47GPQ", "first_seen": 1794524400.0, "review_rank": 33}